    {
      "name": "places/ChIJO-nfmZT0aS4RTGfvOQ-x-wc/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNhX3BhaWZREAE",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "5 years ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "Old bakery and fave by so many people, and that is for a good reason.\nThere is 2 location of Jessy Bread that I know, the other one is at Cibubur and I visited it several times.\n\nFamous for their affordable cakes, match quality for that price range. Quite complete selection including those trendy one like Red Velvet and Rainbow cake.\nBut I like their traditional cakes and bread selection more.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "Old bakery and fave by so many people, and that is for a good reason.\nThere is 2 location of Jessy Bread that I know, the other one is at Cibubur and I visited it several times.\n\nFamous for their affordable cakes, match quality for that price range. Quite complete selection including those trendy one like Red Velvet and Rainbow cake.\nBut I like their traditional cakes and bread selection more.",
