      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "8 years ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "This place has two floors, in the first floor, they open a bakery shop and in the second floor, they open a restaurant. For the bakery, they have wide varieties of bread and cake, the taste are quite good. For the restaurant, they open from 12.00 until 21.00, they serves not to much varieties of food but the taste are quite good and the price are inexpensive.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
